Dear list,

Hi. In the list at the bottom of the message I put some data about plant
volumes and weights in 2 maize genotypes (I have several more, but
putting only 2 will be enough for the example). By using 'dlply' I fit
one linear model relating weight1~volume1 to each genotype, and them
extracted the coefficients with 'ldply'.

I want to calculate a new variable based on the 'volume2' values by
using the coefficients of each fitted model,(e.g. weight2 = Intercept +
slope*volume2).

As I am newly in plyr I don't know how to do it, but I guess it is
possible. Can someone help me with this?

Thanks in advance,

Alan.

